flowchart TD
 Browser -->|initialize| API[Authenticated FastAPI / API Lambda]
 API -->|presigned PUT| Browser
 Browser -->|CSV bytes| Storage[MinIO locally / versioned S3 on AWS]
 Browser -->|local completion| LocalQueue[PostgreSQL READY job adapter]
 Storage -->|AWS ObjectCreated only| SQS[SQS ingestion + DLQ]
 LocalQueue --> Worker[Local ingestion worker]
 SQS --> Lambda[Ingestion Lambda]
 Worker --> Domain[Shared streaming ingestion]
 Lambda --> Domain
 Domain --> DB[(PostgreSQL)]
 DB --> Outbox[Outbox dispatcher]
 Outbox -->|secret authenticated| B[n8n B matching]
 B --> Match[Private matching API / SQL]
 Match --> DB
 Outbox -->|after B audit| C[n8n C notifications]
 C --> Notify[Private notification API]
 Notify --> Mail[Mailpit / SES allowlisted test]
 A[n8n A daily schedule] --> Gate[Source permission review]
 Gate --> HTTP[Official page HTTP fetch]
 HTTP --> Extract[Deterministic extraction and validation]
 Extract --> DB
